.Dd October 7, 2026
.Dt BETACAL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm betacal
.Nd deterministic Gregorian calendar and print-layout toolkit
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Op Ar options
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
calculates Gregorian calendar grids and undated planner layouts offline.
.Nm betacal-layout
remains available as a compatibility command name.
Supported commands are
.Ic month ,
.Ic year ,
.Ic blank ,
.Ic paper ,
.Ic compare ,
.Ic inspect ,
.Ic validate ,
and
.Ic version .
.Sh EXAMPLES
Show January 2027 with Monday as the first weekday:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
betacal month --year 2027 --month 1 --week-start monday
.Ed
.Pp
Create an undated landscape A4 grid as SVG:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
betacal blank --rows 6 --paper a4 --orientation landscape --format svg
.Ed
.Pp
Validate calendar topology from 1900 through 2100:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
betacal validate --from-year 1900 --to-year 2100
.Ed
.Sh OUTPUT
Where supported, output formats are text, JSON, CSV, and SVG. Use
the
.Fl --output
option to write output to a file.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr betacal-layout 1
